      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Library room booking research"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "A formative case report for the service design team"
    },
    {
      "style": "CaseMetadata",
      "text": "Study ST01 / Draft 1 / 24 September 2026 / Fictional demonstration"
    },
    {
      "style": "CaseEvidence",
      "text": "Prepared by Mina Ortiz, research lead, for the library service design team. All participants, records,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Keep the current prototype in research. The booking path needs clearer room discovery and an…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The team asked whether a visitor could locate a suitable room, choose an available time and recognize…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "1 Study and task"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "ST01 used moderated, individual sessions with six fictional adult participants, P01 through P06. Each…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "E01 through E08 are synthetic observation records for this teaching example. The report counts people…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The researcher grouped observations by the point in the task where they affected progress.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Caption",
      "text": "Figure 1. The task presented in ST01: find a room, choose a time, then confirm a booking. The arrows…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "2 Findings and proposed responses"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Read each finding as an argument that can be checked against the evidence register. Occurrence, impact,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "F01 Room discovery starts in the wrong place"
    },
    {
      "style": "CaseEvidence",
      "text": "Occurrence 4 of 6 people / Task impact delay / Confidence moderate / Effort unestimated / Access effect…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Observation. P01, P02, P04 and P06 first opened the events calendar when asked to reserve a room. Three…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Interpretation. The events label may match the way these participants thought about reserving a time.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "CaseEvidence",
      "text": "Illustrative fixture quotation. P04: “I thought the calendar was where I would reserve a time.” This…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Proposed response D01. Test a clearly named room-booking entry alongside the existing calendar. Record…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "F02 The confirmation does not settle the question"
    },
    {
      "style": "CaseEvidence",
      "text": "Occurrence 3 of 6 people / Task impact uncertainty / Confidence moderate / Effort unestimated / Access…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Observation. After pressing the final button, P02, P03 and P05 looked for another action or asked…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Interpretation. The final state may not provide enough information for a visitor to recognize…"
    },
    {
      "style": "CaseEvidence",
      "text": "Evidence note. No quotation is needed to support this finding. The recorded follow-up actions provide…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Proposed response D02. Prototype a persistent summary containing room, date, time and a clear next…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "F03 Keyboard focus blocks the time choice"
    },
    {
      "style": "CaseEvidence",
      "text": "Occurrence 1 of 6 people / Task impact blocks progress / Confidence high for observed barrier / Effort…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Observation. P06 could reach the room list using the keyboard but could not move focus to an available…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Interpretation. The missing keyboard route is a direct obstacle in this prototype. Its low occurrence…"
    },
    {
      "style": "CaseEvidence",
      "text": "Evidence note. The source is an observed interaction sequence, not a satisfaction score. E08 records…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Proposed response D03. Investigate focus order before another participant session, then verify that a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "3 Decisions and limits"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The proposed sequence is to investigate D03 first, then test the navigation and confirmation changes in…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A retest should preserve the booking task but avoid teaching participants where to click. Record…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Limits. Six synthetic sessions are a teaching fixture, not a representative sample. Mobile use, screen…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "4 Evidence register"
    },
    {
      "style": "Caption",
      "text": "Table 1. Synthetic records supporting ST01. IDs connect to findings and proposed decisions. A repeated…"
